{"id":"n45115-1-10","stage":4,"title":"길쭉하다 · 稍长","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n45115-1-10-1","ko":"아저씨, 여기 길쭉한 오이는 얼마인가요?","zh":"大叔，这里的长黄瓜多少钱？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아저씨,","meaning":"大叔，叔叔","explanation":"아저씨：大叔，叔叔。","readings":[{"term":"아저씨","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26237","senseId":"2","lemma":"아저씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아저씨","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3"}},{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"길쭉한","meaning":"稍长","explanation":"길쭉하다：稍长；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"길쭉하다","audio":"/audio/f05e7d1fd5f9970ba832.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45115","senseId":"1","lemma":"길쭉하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길쭉한","audio":"/audio/bd37f8b3dfb2a579adef.mp3"}},{"text":"오이는","meaning":"黄瓜","explanation":"오이：黄瓜；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오이","audio":"/audio/3ba1c580e4879ae2e56e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68059","senseId":"1","lemma":"오이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오이는","audio":"/audio/94fff5b47e22aab5e0b8.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마인가요?","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마인가요","audio":"/audio/08ddfb23a6b93d1e2e6d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"14cf4d2fee0defcf","term":"아저씨","zh":"大叔，叔叔","audio":"/audio/14cf4d2fee0defcf1f6b.mp3","entryId":"26237","definition":"陌生人之间用于指称或称呼没有老的成年男子。","pronunciation":["아저씨"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"f05e7d1fd5f9970b","term":"길쭉하다","zh":"稍长","audio":"/audio/f05e7d1fd5f9970ba832.mp3","entryId":"45115","definition":"略微长。","pronunciation":["길쭈카다"]},{"id":"3ba1c580e4879ae2","term":"오이","zh":"黄瓜","audio":"/audio/3ba1c580e4879ae2e56e.mp3","entryId":"68059","definition":"夏天开黄花，结草绿色的长条椭圆形果实的植物；或指该果实。","pronunciation":["오이"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]}],"audio":"/audio/c812986c7eb67a4c3a31.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n45115-1-10-2","ko":"네, 다섯 개에 삼천 원입니다.","zh":"是的，五个三千韩元。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"다섯","meaning":"五","explanation":"다섯：五。","readings":[{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58111","senseId":"1","lemma":"다섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}},{"text":"개에","meaning":"个","explanation":"개：个；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"개","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22784","senseId":"1","lemma":"개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개에","audio":"/audio/61a9b2592f6ffed14dd3.mp3"}},{"text":"삼천","meaning":"3000（汉字数词）","explanation":"삼천：3000（汉字数词）。","readings":[{"term":"삼천","audio":"/audio/2476947d94471a9ae84d.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삼천","audio":"/audio/2476947d94471a9ae84d.mp3"}},{"text":"원입니다.","meaning":"韩元，